<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 18 August <span class="n">7</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/walafrid-strabo"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/walafrid-strabo.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Walafrid Strabo</span><span class="tp">c. 808–849</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/narapatisithu"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/narapatisithu.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Narapatisithu</span><span class="tp">1150–1211</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/theodore-ii-laskaris"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/theodore-ii-laskaris.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Theodore II Laskaris</span><span class="tp">1221–1258</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/pope-alexander-vi"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/pope-alexander-vi.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Pope Alexander VI</span><span class="tp">1431–1503</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/pope-paul-iv"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/pope-paul-iv.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Pope Paul IV</span><span class="tp">1476–1559</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/wanli-emperor"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/wanli-emperor.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Wanli Emperor</span><span class="tp">1563–1620</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/francis-i-holy-roman-emperor"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/francis-i-holy-roman-emperor.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Francis I, Holy Roman Emperor</span><span class="tp">1708–1765</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
